2026-10-18T14:44:57.3922688Z # Fail-closed, on the paths-file step's own principle: a derivation
2026-10-18T14:44:57.3923200Z # that fails must fail the step, because an empty red list read from
2026-10-18T14:44:57.3923637Z # a failed fetch is "no reds" -- the fail-open this wiring closes.
2026-10-18T14:44:57.3924002Z gh api --paginate \
2026-10-18T14:44:57.3924354Z   "repos/${GITHUB_REPOSITORY}/commits/${PR_HEAD}/check-runs" \
